## T-011b — Column-level filter, 3-guruh (work-schedules, attendance, payroll)

**Holat:** ACCEPTED

**Tekshiruv:** AGY 3 sahifaga (`work-schedule-list`, `attendance-list`,
`payroll-list`) filter qatorini `design-reference.md` bo'lim 3.2
bo'yicha qo'shdi. Tekshirildi:
- Faqat `.ts`/`.html` fayllar o'zgargan (CSS'ga tegilmagan).
- `work-schedule-list`dagi mavjud actions-cell `git diff`da ko'rinmadi
